{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id217799496"}, "name":{"label":"CanadianJesse"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-26T09:29:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"12357926596"}, "title":{"label":"AMAZING “To-do” App"}, "content":{"label":"This app is a game changer! All of my appointments and to-do items get put in one place. I can easily see what’s on my schedule for the day and to-do’s I didn’t get time for the day before. Pro is well worth the money and they even offer a scholarship program for anyone who needs support buying Pro. \n\nIt has beautiful visuals and is easy to use. Free version is pretty good too. You get most of the features.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id161897184"}, "name":{"label":"There is an App For That"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-26T08:33:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"12357753498"}, "title":{"label":"Evaluation & Suggestion For Improvement"}, "content":{"label":"This is a comprehensive, robust app is presented to the user with a friendly interface that makes data entry, and importantly, editing and updating quite easy. Although feature rich, the one element I find lacking, is an internal full screen monthly calendar, similar to the Apple Calendar, which allows \"at-a-glance\" viewing of commitments to assist forward planning. The app contains a monthly feature but only contains dates and tiny icons. This is the best planner that I found through the years of searching for the \"Holy Grail\". It is one step short of perfection. Congratulations to the designers and programmers on a job done well.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
