{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1430003947"}, "name":{"label":"Boris Ykhin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-01T10:33:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"12258290991"}, "title":{"label":"Great app, but there’s room for improvement"}, "content":{"label":"The app is convenient and well-structured, but a few features are missing. It would be helpful to add timer sounds for focus—different melodies for work and break periods. Additionally, the ability to upload custom sounds or voice reminders would be great, allowing tasks to be associated with specific actions. Another important feature would be automatic task adjustments when one is moved so that they don’t overlap. Lastly, when adding a new task, it should appear in the selected time slot rather than at the end of the day. Hopefully, the developers will consider these ideas!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
