{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id589644747"}, "name":{"label":"Princess (TikTok Fan)"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-27T07:29:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.8.5"}, "id":{"label":"12112063686"}, "title":{"label":"Great but.."}, "content":{"label":"The app itself is very aesthetically pleasing. It provides lots of feautures, like AI being enabled, and it’s very easy to manage. However, alot of the good features do require payment which is unfortunate. Planning takes way longer when you have an everyday scedule as the “everyday task” feature costs premium. You’d have to manually add all the tasks, things that you do everyday, which is way too time consuming especially if your on a busy scedule. It’s small features like this that make the app harder or more tedious to use. Overall, its a good app but definitely needs payment if you want the full experience.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1499198946&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
